00:04:48.160 --> 00:04:49.970
other organizations.

00:04:49.970 --> 00:04:52.990
So there we go.

00:04:52.990 --> 00:04:54.550
So our goal in
this collaboration,

00:04:54.550 --> 00:04:56.210
this particular
collaboration, is

00:04:56.210 --> 00:04:59.320
to help many scientists
analyze large earth science

00:04:59.320 --> 00:05:01.120
